OL,3,CMan and woman die and two men arrested
OL,4,Cafter car crashes into digger
OL,6,FA man and a woman have died after a
OL,7,Fcar crashed into a digger.
OL,9,FEmergency services received reports of
OL,10,Fa collision at around 9:35pm on Hyde
OL,11,FRoad in Gorton, Manchester Thursday 5
OL,12,FAugust. The digger was stationary at
OL,13,Fthe time of the crash.
OL,15,FTwo other men who were inside the car
OL,16,Fwere seriously injured and were taken
OL,17,Fto hospital for treatment.
OL,19,FThey were arrested on suspicion of
OL,20,Fcausing death by dangerous driving and
OL,21,Fare in police custody.
