OL,3,CMan and woman die and two men arrested
OL,4,Cafter car crashes into digger
OL,6,FDetective Sergeant Louise Warhurst
OL,7,Ffrom Greater Manchester Police said:
OL,8,F"Our thoughts are with the family and
OL,9,Ffriends of the victims in this tragic
OL,10,Fincident.
OL,12,F"We are appealing for any witnesses
OL,13,Fwho may have saw the moments leading
OL,14,Fup to this incident, or anyone who has
OL,15,Fmobile phone, Ring doorbell or dash
OL,16,Fcam footage, to come forward and
OL,17,Fassist our investigation.
